{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16071","headline":"同于汝锡赏白牡丹 · 王建","name":"同于汝锡赏白牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓日花初吐，春寒白未凝。\n月光裁不得，苏合点难胜。\n柔腻於云叶，新鲜掩鹤膺。\n统心黄倒晕，侧茎紫重棱。\n乍敛看如睡，初开问欲譍。\n竝香幽蕙死，比艳美人憎。\n价数千金贵，形相两眼疼。\n自知颜色好，愁被彩光凌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}